/* ============================================================================
   FACTION CODEX
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The art — four crests and four commander portraits — lives in assets/factions,
   cut out by tools/make-faction-art.py. This file is everything the game needs
   to SHOW it: identity, doctrine, and the roster each faction fields.

   Nova Federation is the player's own banner rather than an opponent, which is
   why it is described here but never appears in the enemy picker. The other
   three are the selectable AI factions in src/game/ai.js, and the keys match
   that table exactly so the two can never drift apart.

   Crests are <img> rather than inline SVG on purpose: they are painted art with
   bevels and internal glow, and tracing them to vectors would lose the thing
   that makes them look expensive. Each one ships at 256/96/48 so the browser is
   never asked to downscale a 256 into a 24px chip.
   ============================================================================ */

